===Etymology===
There are two alternatives for the family name:
* Variant of the English and {{der|en|fr|-}} surname [[Morant]], of unknown origin ([[morant]] "cubic" has been suggested).
* Anglicization of {{der|en|ga|Ó Mórain||descendant of a person named Big}} or {{m|ga|Ó Mughráin}}

